{"lang":"en","summary":"Navigation: 工具调用与MCP MOC","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Function Calling 与 MCP 在实际项目中的架构设计\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"工具调用与MCP\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> advanced\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/工具调用\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/advanced</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/04-%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP/%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP%20MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/04-%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP/%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP%20MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">工具调用与MCP MOC</a></p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">在实际项目中，如何设计一套结合 Function Calling 和 MCP 的 Agent 工具调用架构？需要考虑哪些工程问题？</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">在实际项目中，Function Calling 和 MCP 需要协同工作，构成\"模型决策层 + 协议通信层 + 工具执行层\"的三层架构。</p>\n<h3 data-heading=\"生产级架构设计\" dir=\"auto\">生产级架构设计</h3>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                          Agent Host                                  │\n│                                                                      │\n│  ┌──────────────┐    ┌──────────────┐    ┌──────────────┐         │\n│  │   用户接口    │    │   会话管理    │    │   上下文管理  │         │\n│  │  (Web/CLI)   │    │  (Session)   │    │  (Context)   │         │\n│  └──────┬───────┘    └──────┬───────┘    └──────┬───────┘         │\n│         │                   │                   │                   │\n│         └───────────────────┼───────────────────┘                   │\n│                             ▼                                       │\n│  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐  │\n│  │                    Function Calling 层                        │  │\n│  │  ┌──────────┐  ┌──────────┐  ┌──────────┐  ┌──────────┐    │  │\n│  │  │ 意图识别  │→│ 工具选择  │→│ 参数提取  │→│ JSON输出  │    │  │\n│  │  └──────────┘  └──────────┘  └──────────┘  └──────────┘    │  │\n│  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘  │\n│                             │                                       │\n│                             ▼                                       │\n│  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐  │\n│  │                    MCP 通信层                                 │  │\n│  │  ┌──────────┐  ┌──────────┐  ┌──────────┐  ┌──────────┐    │  │\n│  │  │工具发现  │  │Schema转换│  │请求路由  │  │结果解析  │    │  │\n│  │  └──────────┘  └──────────┘  └──────────┘  └──────────┘    │  │\n│  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘  │\n│         │              │              │                             │\n│         ▼              ▼              ▼                             │\n│  ┌──────────────┐ ┌──────────────┐ ┌──────────────┐              │\n│  │ MCP Client 1  │ │ MCP Client 2  │ │ MCP Client 3  │              │\n│  │ (文件系统)    │ │ (数据库)      │ │ (外部API)     │              │\n│  └──────┬───────┘ └──────┬───────┘ └──────┬───────┘              │\n└─────────┼────────────────┼────────────────┼──────────────────────┘\n          │                │                │\n    ┌─────▼─────┐   ┌─────▼─────┐   ┌─────▼─────┐\n    │ Filesystem │   │  Database │   │  External │\n    │   Server   │   │   Server  │   │   Server  │\n    └────────────┘   └────────────┘   └────────────┘\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h3 data-heading=\"关键工程考量\" dir=\"auto\">关键工程考量</h3>\n<h4 data-heading=\"1. 工具路由层\" dir=\"auto\">1. 工具路由层</h4>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">ToolRouter</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"工具路由器：根据工具名称路由到对应的 MCP Client\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>clients<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> Dict<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> MCPClient<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tool_registry<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> Dict<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># tool_name -&gt; client_id</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">register_client</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> client_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> client<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> MCPClient<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"注册 MCP Client 并发现其工具\"\"\"</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>clients<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>client_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> client\n        tools <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> client<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>list_tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> tool <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tool_registry<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>tool<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>name<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> client_id\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">route_tool_call</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tool_name<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> arguments<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"路由工具调用到正确的 Client\"\"\"</span>\n        client_id <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tool_registry<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>tool_name<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">not</span> client_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">raise</span> ValueError<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"未找到工具 '</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>tool_name<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">' 的注册信息\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        client <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>clients<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>client_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> client<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>call_tool<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>tool_name<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> arguments<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h4 data-heading=\"2. Schema 转换层\" dir=\"auto\">2. Schema 转换层</h4>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">SchemaConverter</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"将 MCP 工具定义转换为 Function Calling Schema\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token decorator annotation punctuation\">@staticmethod</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">mcp_to_function_schema</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>mcp_tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"MCP Tool Schema → Function Calling Schema\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"type\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"function\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"function\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n                    <span class=\"token string\">\"name\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> tool<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"name\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                    <span class=\"token string\">\"description\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> tool<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"description\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                    <span class=\"token string\">\"parameters\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> tool<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"inputSchema\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n                <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> tool <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> mcp_tools\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token decorator annotation punctuation\">@staticmethod</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">function_to_mcp_call</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>function_call<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"Function Calling 输出 → MCP 工具调用\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"name\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> function_call<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"name\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"arguments\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> json<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>loads<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>function_call<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"arguments\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h4 data-heading=\"3. 安全执行层\" dir=\"auto\">3. 安全执行层</h4>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">SecureToolExecutor</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"安全工具执行器（完整实现）\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> router<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> ToolRouter<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> acl<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> ToolACL<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>router <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> router\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>acl <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> acl\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>audit_logger <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> AuditLogger<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>rate_limiter <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> RateLimiter<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">execute</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> user_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tool_call<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> context<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        tool_name <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> tool_call<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"name\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 1. 权限检查</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">not</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>acl<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>can_execute<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>user_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tool_name<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">raise</span> PermissionError<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"无权调用工具 </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>tool_name<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 2. 限流检查</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">not</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>rate_limiter<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>allow<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>user_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tool_name<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">raise</span> RateLimitError<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"调用过于频繁，请稍后重试\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 3. 审计记录</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>audit_logger<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>log_call<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>user_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tool_call<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 4. 执行工具调用</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">try</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            result <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>router<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>route_tool_call<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n                tool_name<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> \n                tool_call<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"arguments\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>audit_logger<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>log_success<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>user_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tool_call<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> result<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> result\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">except</span> Exception <span class=\"token keyword\">as</span> e<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>audit_logger<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>log_failure<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>user_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tool_call<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>e<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">raise</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h4 data-heading=\"4. 会话状态管理\" dir=\"auto\">4. 会话状态管理</h4>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">SessionManager</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"会话状态管理器\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> redis_client<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>redis <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> redis_client\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>session_ttl <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">3600</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 1小时过期</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">get_session</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> session_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"获取会话状态\"\"\"</span>\n        data <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>redis<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"session:</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>session_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> data<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> json<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>loads<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>data<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"messages\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"tool_calls\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"created_at\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> time<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>time<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">update_session</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> session_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> session<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"更新会话状态\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>redis<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>setex<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n            <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"session:</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>session_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>session_ttl<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            json<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>dumps<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>session<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">add_tool_call</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> session_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tool_call<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> result<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"记录工具调用历史\"\"\"</span>\n        session <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get_session<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>session_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        session<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"tool_calls\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"tool\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> tool_call<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"result\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> result<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"timestamp\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> time<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>time<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>update_session<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>session_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> session<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h3 data-heading=\"生产部署清单\" dir=\"auto\">生产部署清单</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>检查项</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>优先级</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>工具 Schema 校验</td>\n<td>所有工具定义必须通过 Schema 校验</td>\n<td>P0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>权限控制</td>\n<td>按角色限制可调用工具范围</td>\n<td>P0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>限流保护</td>\n<td>防止工具被过度调用</td>\n<td>P0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超时控制</td>\n<td>工具调用设置合理超时</td>\n<td>P0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误处理</td>\n<td>工具失败有降级策略</td>\n<td>P0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>审计日志</td>\n<td>所有调用记录完整审计日志</td>\n<td>P1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>监控告警</td>\n<td>调用成功率、延迟实时监控</td>\n<td>P1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>健康检查</td>\n<td>MCP Server 健康状态检测</td>\n<td>P1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自动重连</td>\n<td>MCP Client 断线自动重连</td>\n<td>P1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>灰度发布</td>\n<td>新工具先小范围验证</td>\n<td>P2</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Q: 如何处理 MCP Server 宕机的情况？</strong><br>\nA: 实现健康检查 + 自动重连 + 熔断机制。Server 不可用时暂时从工具列表中移除，恢复后自动重新发现。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Q: 工具调用的性能瓶颈通常在哪？</strong><br>\nA: 主要在三个环节：LLM 推理延迟（工具决策）、MCP 通信延迟（网络 IO）、工具执行延迟（数据库查询等）。应分别优化。</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">常见误区</h2>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>误区</strong>：Function Calling 和 MCP 只需要简单拼接。<br>\n<strong>纠正</strong>：中间需要 Schema 转换、路由、安全校验等多个环节。</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>误区</strong>：会话状态可以存在内存里。<br>\n<strong>纠正</strong>：生产环境必须用 Redis 等外部存储，支持多实例部署和断点续传。</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>误区</strong>：所有工具走同一个超时设置。<br>\n<strong>纠正</strong>：不同工具的执行时间差异很大，应该按工具类型设置不同超时。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>","headings":[]}